{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fisherman and the Drifting Bottle</i> is a unique <strong>desktop idle game</strong>. Instead of dominating your screen, it resides quietly as a narrow strip at the bottom. Whether you are working, studying, browsing the web, or watching videos, the lonely fisherman will always be there with you\u2014fishing, waiting, and keeping watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No constant interaction is required; the fisherman catches fish automatically. With its non-intrusive design, the game blends perfectly into your desktop environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>180 unique types of fish</strong>, each with imaginative images, names, and descriptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a complete encyclopedia (Pokedex) and fishing achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/0ca72636c191be12346ecc6086be6343.avif?t=1771957362\" width=785 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/c0bd46434a8646f8d08ed8c7bed7cecc.poster.avif?t=1771957362\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/c0bd46434a8646f8d08ed8c7bed7cecc.webm?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/c0bd46434a8646f8d08ed8c7bed7cecc.mp4?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Drift Bottles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the soul of the game. Use your fishing earnings to purchase exquisite bottles, stamps, and gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Send:</strong> Write down the thoughts, secrets, or wishes you cannot share with people in real life. Seal them in a bottle and cast them into the vast ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/06ecf99e03a7cff0a27d6b8687f56c8e.poster.avif?t=1771957362\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/06ecf99e03a7cff0a27d6b8687f56c8e.webm?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/06ecf99e03a7cff0a27d6b8687f56c8e.mp4?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retrieve:</strong> Randomly fish up bottles sent by strangers from around the world. It might be a simple &quot;good night,&quot; a joke, or a touching story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/0768788c906536052b8798c4159b95e0.poster.avif?t=1771957362\" width=846 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/0768788c906536052b8798c4159b95e0.webm?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/0768788c906536052b8798c4159b95e0.mp4?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean tides are unpredictable. When will your letter arrive? When will you get a reply? Every moment is an unknown surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some drift bottles, you may find a piece of parchment. It could be a word of encouragement, a sad thought, a famous quote, lyrics, or a poem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared over <strong>2000 notes</strong>, and every content will be translated into your language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/7486006f12341bf4e6d6f2230d54539e.avif?t=1771957362\" width=623 height=411 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/eeff06aa11ed8cd3b3aa2e142496351f.avif?t=1771957362\" width=690 height=464 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/536d85aeeb35e030a1f96ad3a12d2cd5.avif?t=1771957362\" width=642 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like a note, you can also add it to your bookmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides drift bottles, you can also consume stamps to communicate in real-time based on the other person's address.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/9b19842c1e97f1b8afb51f260427c3be.avif?t=1771957362\" width=585 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can become even smaller and more hidden, ensuring it never interrupts your work.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/eb8152d80f3d1e62a7d45fcfc4aca2a4.poster.avif?t=1771957362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/eb8152d80f3d1e62a7d45fcfc4aca2a4.webm?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/eb8152d80f3d1e62a7d45fcfc4aca2a4.mp4?t=1771957362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fishing Ace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/3779530f7bea9f321e51c7279c2343262afa4116.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/fa2549fa9addaf31c5ce281645a511531558fe84.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/494a81334185a0b50e4d02fcd653400a6d860b9b.jpg"},{"name":"Fragments","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/40758ed65c7c24db8c352b76f7a36eb06054e31b.jpg"},{"name":"Thought Scavenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/54e52f454f2eb51f96663a87667c0cbf6e744989.jpg"},{"name":"Message in a Bottle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/992d2002bf571158cbb14037be437f2a8bd05dd4.jpg"},{"name":"Pen Pal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/6ddf4dad889b51216ccbdeb3de05c0163f853157.jpg"},{"name":"Gift of the Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/0b97da22c57e5827bfa2838f65fac7cf90d6bd8a.jpg"},{"name":"Stroke of Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/51efeadceb211d91029de4f149b267a56c6909c8.jpg"},{"name":"VVVVIP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3431580/1fa31e8579b51bf9240ceb7fbe3e5378eced8b2d.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431580?t=1771957362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431580?t=1771957362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/494b8e4cca99692950737cd32a8ba791bbf4d364/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771957362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/494b8e4cca99692950737cd32a8ba791bbf4d364/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771957362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fisherman and the Drifting Bottle</i> is a unique <strong>desktop idle game</strong>. Instead of dominating your screen, it resides quietly as a narrow strip at the bottom. Whether you are working, studying, browsing the web, or watching videos, the lonely fisherman will always be there with you\u2014fishing, waiting, and keeping watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No constant interaction is required; the fisherman catches fish automatically. With its non-intrusive design, the game blends perfectly into your desktop environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>180 unique types of fish</strong>, each with imaginative images, names, and descriptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a complete encyclopedia (Pokedex) and fishing achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431580/extras/0ca72636c191be12346ecc6086be6343.avif?t=1771957362\" width=785 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app